  "source_ref": "Trenz TE0950-03 REV03 schematic, sheets FMC.SchDoc (p32) and V_GTYP.SchDoc (p12). Only DP0-3 (GTYP quad 103; lane order reversed: DP0=lane3 .. DP3=lane0) and GBTCLK0/1 (AC-coupled via 10nF C53-C56 to GTYP REFCLK1_103/REFCLK0_103) reach the Versal. All 34 LA pairs, CLK0/1_M2C, CLK2/3_BIDIR, CLK_DIR, SCL/SDA, PRSNT_M2C_L and PG route to the on-board Artix-7 levelshifter/MUX U13 (A_HR sheets p29-30), not the Versal, and are omitted (closed-world; TRM v.11 sec 5.1 confirms this architecture). Trenz GBTCLK net names are swapped vs VITA positions (J3 D4/D5 carry net GBTCLK1_M2C_*, B20/B21 carry net GBTCLK0_M2C_*); canonical names here follow connector position. VREF_A_M2C and GA0/GA1 excluded per repo convention.",
